00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.120
'Thunderbolt Fantasy' gave us a curveball to look at

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.520
by making a show using Taiwanese puppets!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.380
wait hold on a second

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.000
